        "name": "食谱：桔桔薄饼",
        "desc": "<p><span>步骤详实的食谱，记载着「桔桔薄饼」的制作方法。</span></p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/10/23/88072335/955d23a38b8e91a5e5c9de7547d7a320_3219457022336375967.png",
