        "desc": "<p>步骤详实的食谱，记载着「缤纷马卡龙」的制作方法。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/01/06/157749474/955d23a38b8e91a5e5c9de7547d7a320_3045311146204651201.png",
