        "name": "食谱：贝壳彩糖",
        "desc": "<p>步骤详实的食谱，记载着「贝壳彩糖」的制作方法。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/09/27/60c9c277139b43907167e6452d409874_7668299764384701555.png",
